@startuml Preciazo_Shopping_Planning_States
title Preciazo - Shopping List and Recurrence Lifecycle (AV2)
skinparam shadowing false
state ACTIVE
state COMPLETED
[*] --> ACTIVE : create normally or instantiate template\nall purchased=false
ACTIVE --> COMPLETED : buyer explicitly completes nonempty list
note right of ACTIVE
 Add/remove/reduce items, set budget and mark/unmark purchases.
 Optimistic version check; warnings are query-derived.
 No automatic completion when all items are marked.
end note
note right of COMPLETED
 Read-only; repeated completion is a no-op.
 Completion does not assert that every requested item was bought.
 Save an immutable template containing all requested products/quantities.
 Template instantiation creates another ACTIVE list, not a reopening.
 Missing/stale required prices create no partial list.
end note
@enduml
